Add ROM ets_printf heartbeat probes to bisect the silent-boot stop.
nx_start(): @G/@GA/@GB/@GC/@GD split @G->hardware_initialize();
hardware_initialize(): @HW0..@HW10 split each subsystem call; @H after return.
nx_bringup(): @K prints init task_spawn ret. All use ROM ets_printf.
Debug-only; revert once the stop is located.
